<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST370"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->A Criminal Lawyer<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, June 30, 2004 - 11:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear BTK, <BR> <BR>Whereas others refuse to listen to your plaintive cries, I&#39;d be happy to listen to your story.  I&#39;m a semiretired criminal lawyer and have represented many killers.  My goal is not to capture or even identify BTK, but to quiet the monster, so that the HURTING STOPS. <BR> <BR>As a criminal defense lawyer, I can find a sympathetic counselor in your area, who will listen to you without snitching.  Rest assured, I will never betray you.  However, I will do everything possible to provide the counseling needed to quiet the monster and STOP THE HURTING. <BR> <BR>To facilitate communication, I&#39;ll reserve an email address for us at your high school &#40;all lower case, minus the word school&#41;@yahoo.com.  Your password will be the nickname of your first camera. <BR> <BR>Take care and I&#39;ll communicate with you soon. <BR> <BR>A Criminal Lawyer <BR>  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 370-->
<!--Post: 387--><!--Time: 1089090252-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST387"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, July 05, 2004 - 10:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, if you want to go down in the history books, turn yourself in and let the history lesson get started. Old fashioned pens will be scratching and modern computers will be whirring with information. Can you imagine the emails and telephone calls that will be generated by your confession? Please do it now. We are waiting for you... <BR>-flytodeb<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 387-->
<!--Post: 395--><!--Time: 1089225874-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST395"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jaden<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, July 07, 2004 - 11:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey BTK, <BR> <BR>You are dying anyway. You know it and I know it. I do not feel sorry for you. They are on your tail now. You are the ultimate PU$$Y. Killing little children and women. Masturbating over thier lifeless bodies. SICK, SICK, SICK! <BR> <BR>You better hop on your private plane and get the heck outta the desert. Tick, Tick, Tick, Tick... Time is not on your side. Coleman covered a hell of a lot for you. They are singing like birds now.  <BR> <BR>Feel the hot breath of justcie on your neck? I just bet you do! <BR> <BR>Your Priest will not have enough Hail Mary&#39;s to gain God&#39;s forgiveness. What a good Catholic you are, Coach.  <BR> <BR>Jaden<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 395-->
<!--Post: 551--><!--Time: 1090549061-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST551"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:littledaisymae2003@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->M. C. Adamson<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 22, 2004 - 7:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK Please do turnyourself  in.  This is not a game tp hide behind. 5 people are dead at your hand.  Or so we are led to believe.  Actually, I think you are a fake and didn&#39;t kill anyone.  So you need help.  Please contact that attorney.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
